  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help a Poor Brainy Nigerian Girl to Stay in School</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will support Michelle, an intelligent girl from a poor family and an undergraduate at Nnamdi Azikiwe University Nnewi campus, to buy an android phone in order to aid her education, as hers was stolen and this is seriously affecting her studies. Phones are not only used as a means of communication but also used by students to learn and research online for assignments. May you be richly blessed as you donate to help us in supporting this poor intelligent girl.</narrative>
  </description>
